2679905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3933500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge from your underground vault into a hostile post-apocalyptic wasteland in this fast-paced roguelike that blends intense combat with rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/5763fb7aac0f70973e7f71e0d58f1f44.poster.avif?t=1762679905\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/5763fb7aac0f70973e7f71e0d58f1f44.webm?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/5763fb7aac0f70973e7f71e0d58f1f44.mp4?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through bullet-hell encounters in tight 20-minute runs. Face hordes of varied enemies and challenging bosses, each requiring different tactical approaches. Choose from dozens of weapons that enable completely different playstyles - from close-quarters brawlers to long-range specialists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/1d1298fde69e16e