ay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/091bbb0eaba2f551c19119f41dbb2b3d.poster.avif?t=1762679905\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/091bbb0eaba2f551c19119f41dbb2b3d.webm?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/091bbb0eaba2f551c19119f41dbb2b3d.mp4?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Invest resources earned from runs into expanding and improving your vault. Unlock new facilities and upgrade existing systems. Your vault grows stronger with each expedition, providing permanent benefits for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/0fd97ae1aefd3e6e861764c92ce95530.poster.avif?t=1762679905\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/0fd97ae1aefd3e6e861764c92ce95530.webm?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/extras/0fd97ae1aefd3e6e861764c92ce95530.mp4?t=1762679905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-minute roguelike runs perfect for quick sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemy types and challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons enabling varied playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven conversations with Vault's AI and survivor NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep meta progression through vault construction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric pixel art combining wasteland grit with underground sanctuary aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the surface. Build your sanctuary. Uncover the truth.</p>","developers":["Zyrean Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396140/caae8dfd877a4a908ce38c23c0a52bc5872b8a5a/header.jpg?t=1762679905","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Zyrean Interactive. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396140/797261731/76f21c5fe98f3154676c6b95a478759d2dc51c9f/1761062585/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761064161","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396140/797261731/76f21c5fe98f3154676c6b95a478759d2dc51c9f/1761062585/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761064161","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396140/797261731/76f21c5fe98f3154676c6b95a478759d2dc51c9f/1761062585/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761064161","id":257220570,"name":"Full Version Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220570/ac7cff67c2e6a2d5469d4f23239229e0688d79b9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761064161"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396140/1711826611/cdf0f80339bfccde5654fc81b5f165f68bd82c0f/1754512074/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754950480","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396140/1711826611/cdf0f80339